-- Ascension's Worldforged items, as real item_template rows.
--
-- GENERATED by tools/worldforged/build_ascension_items.py - re-run the tool
-- rather than editing this file.
--
-- Every value here is Ascension's own, read out of their client's item cache
-- (see the tool's docstring for why that is the only surviving source and how
-- the parse is verified). Names, qualities, item levels, slots, armour, damage
-- and stats are exact; the original Ascension item ids are kept, which is safe
-- because nothing in this database uses the 100000+ range.
--
-- Two things are deliberately cleared, because the data they point at does not
